Third-party components
----------------------
All third-party sources are vendored as git submodules under
app/src/main/cpp/third_party/. Each carries its own license file in-tree; this
section summarizes attribution and the applicable license.

1. UxPlay — AirPlay/RAOP protocol core (mDNS/RTSP/RTP, FairPlay handshake,
   pairing). The majority of lib/*.c originates from ShairPlay (LGPLv2.1+,
   Juho Vähä-Herttua) with mirroring code by dsafa22 (LGPLv2.1+) and later
   modifications by fduncanh (GPLv3). The project as a whole is GPLv3.
   Source: https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay  — License: GPLv3 (see its ./LICENSE).

2. PlayFair — FairPlay decryption (lib/playfair/ within UxPlay, by EstebanKubata).
   License: GPLv3 (see lib/playfair/LICENSE.md). Legal status of FairPlay
   reverse-engineering is documented in that file.

3. libplist — Apple binary/XML property-list parsing. Used by the UxPlay core
   for RTSP/plist parsing. Vendored sources (no autotools build).
   Source: https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libplist — License: LGPLv2.1+
   (see COPYING.LESSER). NOTE: statically linked into the .so; object files
   remain relinkable from source on request (LGPL compliance).

4. OpenSSL — cryptography (AES-CTR/CBC/GCM, X25519, Ed25519, SHA, RAND) used by
   UxPlay's lib/crypto.c and lib/srp.c for the pairing layer. Built from source
   via the openssl-cmake wrapper.
   Source: https://www.openssl.org — License: Apache-2.0 (OpenSSL 3.x).
   Wrapper: https://github.com/viaduck/openssl-cmake (MIT).

5. llhttp — HTTP/RTSP request parser (lib/llhttp/ within UxPlay, by Fedor
   Indutny / Joyent / Node.js). License: MIT (see lib/llhttp/LICENSE-MIT).

6. mdnsd — self-contained mDNS responder backend (lib/mdnsd/ within UxPlay, by
   kgbook). NOTE: this backend is NOT compiled into the Android build — actual
   mDNS advertising is delegated to Android's NsdManager. The license is
   retained for completeness: LGPLv2.1+.

7. ALAC — Apple Lossless Audio Codec, software decoder fallback for RAOP audio.
   Source: https://github.com/macosforge/alac — License: Apache-2.0.
   (Wired into the build from milestone M3.)

8. csrp — SRP-6a (lib/srp.c within UxPlay, by Tom Cocagne), modified for Apple
   pair-setup-pin. License: MIT.

